@prefix : <http://example.org/x#> .
@prefix dec: <http://w3id.org/conjectures/> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
# Identity placed in the SHARED world: does it leak into a doxastic world?
:S { :superman owl:sameAs :clark . } :S a dec:sharedWorld .
:LoisB { :superman :canDo :flying . }
:lois :believes :LoisB . :believes a dec:doxasticPredicate .
